*** Settings ***
Documentation       Business actions: generate test data for customers - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/faker_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Generate Random Customer
    [Documentation]    Generates a fake customer with name, e-mail, street, city and date of birth.
    ${name}    Generate Full Name
    ${email}    Generate Email Address
    ${street}    Generate Street
    ${city}    Generate City
    ${birth_date}    Generate Birth Date
    VAR    &{customer}    name=${name}    email=${email}    street=${street}    city=${city}
    ...    birth_date=${birth_date}
    RETURN    ${customer}

Generate Random Customers
    [Documentation]    Generates several fake customers and returns them as a list.
    [Arguments]    ${count}
    VAR    @{customers}    @{EMPTY}
    FOR    ${_}    IN RANGE    ${count}
        ${customer}    Generate Random Customer
        VAR    @{customers}    @{customers}    ${customer}
    END
    RETURN    ${customers}

Collect Email Addresses
    [Documentation]    Returns the e-mail addresses of a list of customers as a list.
    [Arguments]    ${customers}
    VAR    @{addresses}    @{EMPTY}
    FOR    ${customer}    IN    @{customers}
        VAR    @{addresses}    @{addresses}    ${customer}[email]
    END
    RETURN    ${addresses}
